=== the first chapter's FIFO: full is raised at fifteen
--- informal-bmc, limit 3s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
fifo.u_sva.NoOverflow_A      assert  unprocessed
fifo.u_sva.FullForward_A     assert  unprocessed
fifo.u_sva.FullBackward_A    assert  unprocessed
fifo.u_sva.EmptyExact_A      assert  unprocessed
fifo.u_sva.PushFull_A        assert  unprocessed
fifo.u_sva.PopEmpty_A        assert  unprocessed
fifo.u_sva.Sync_A            assert  unprocessed
fifo.u_sva.FullReached_C     cover   undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
fifo.u_sva.PushFull_C        cover   unprocessed
fifo.u_sva.PopEmpty_C        cover   unprocessed
fifo.u_sva.Drained_C         cover   unprocessed
--- informal-kind, limit 20s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
