=== FullReached_C: the FIFO, the engine, its limit, the answer
  first chapter  informal-bmc   3s     undetermined
  first chapter  informal-kind  20s    unreachable
  first chapter  informal-ic3   20s    unreachable
  repaired       informal-bmc   20s    covered, depth 17
  repaired       informal-kind  20s    covered, depth 17
  repaired       informal-ic3   20s    covered, depth 17
verdict: covered is a trace and every engine finds it; unreachable is a proof and bounded search cannot give one
